<group id="general" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1"><label>General</label><comment>Maximum 4 slides. Tip for speed: use webp or avif images, keep each image under 200KB, and upload a separate smaller mobile image.</comment>
